# Trivy vulnerability exceptions.
#
# Add one CVE ID per line, with a comment explaining why it's accepted:
# why it doesn't apply to how this service uses the dependency, or a
# tracking link/date for when the fix will land. Do not add a blanket
# ignore for a whole package - scope every exception to a specific CVE so
# a future fixed version stops being silently ignored too.
#
# Example:
# CVE-2023-12345 # Only exploitable via a code path this service never calls (see #1234). Revisit 2026-Q2.
